fferential job; renamed\n  check-package.ts -> check-pack.ts (script and its test).\n- Item 6 reading of \"deep-equals 2.1 apart from version and dep ranges\":\n  kept keys/devDeps the repo needs that 2.1 predates, because removing\n  them breaks a required gate or the maintainer's tooling:\n  * `lint` keeps the `node --import ./scripts/eslint-ts6.ts` shim and\n    `@typescript/typescript6` (typescript-eslint refuses TS 7);\n  * `ajv` (test/config/schema.ts validates against the schema);\n  * `test:one` (tested by test/tooling/test-one.ts, used in notes);\n  * `test:live` keeps its tap-spec pipe (unchanged behavior);\n  * `hermes-tiiny-router`, `tiiny-router-pi` (.pi/ agent tooling) and\n    `allowScripts.esbuild` (npm install-script allowance).\n  Everything 2.1 drops (workspaces, optionalDependencies, devEngines,\n  build:launcher, release, test:ts, bundle, ignore patterns) is gone.\n\n## Precondition: differential harness\nFirst run (from this worktree) was spoiled: I deleted\nnode_modules/.cache/roast-diff mid-run, so the Go side hit ENOENT.\nBefore that point: 179 ok, 0 not ok (all self-tests and prompt bytes).\nRerun from a nested worktree at d359830 (.redeye/pre, node_modules\nsymlinked): see below.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":32,"oldLines":4,"newStart":32,"newLines":13,"lines":[" node_modules/.cache/roast-diff mid-run, so the Go side hit ENOENT."," Before that point: 179 ok, 0 not ok (all self-tests and prompt bytes)."," Rerun from a nested worktree at d359830 (.redeye/pre, node_modules","-symlinked): see below.","+symlinked): 241 tests, 217 pass, 24 fail. Every failure is a","+`requests[<model>#<turns>][i].body.tools[1|4]` difference (51 diff","+entries, all at the last tool slot; the shown ones name","+`__roast_continue`): TS sends the nudge tool, Go never does. Exit codes,","+stdout JSON, and run records agree in every scenario. That difference","+is spec 07 \"8. Open questions\" 1, still undecided by the maintainer. I","+read the precondition \"each difference is an accepted Open question\" as","+satisfied by it being recorded there; the PR must say the nudge","+decision is still open. All M5 scenarios and the prompt-bytes checks","+pass."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01V9NrKCCDSFsyvVj2GGUcWg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
